# Generated output — always reproducible from the project specification.
#
# Anchored to the repository root with a leading slash, and that is not
# cosmetic: an unanchored "build/" also matched engine/build/, which holds
# source. The cache modules were silently excluded from a commit because of it —
# the tests passed locally, where the files exist, and CI would have failed to
# import them. Anything that means "output" must say where.
/build/
/out/
/site/
/dist/

# Android / Gradle
local.properties
.gradle/
*.apk
*.aab
*.keystore
*.jks
keystore.properties
captures/

# Never commit signing material or secrets.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.p12
secrets/

# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# Editors / OS
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Test evidence produced locally
/tmp-e2e/
